      "y_axis": "Scheduling & Dispatch Depth (basic calendar → intelligent dispatch)",
      "rationale": "Reveals the core strategic split: ServiceTitan is powerful but over-built for SMBs; Jobber is SMB-friendly but broad and shallow on dispatch; Housecall Pro sits in between. Cadence should be the SMB-native, dispatch-deep quadrant occupant. Both dimensions are real buyer decision criteria."
